Many people replied to it already, I just want to point out that the chances 
that the poison on the dart is fatal is very small (1/30 if I read correctly).
Fold it with the chances that the dart is not poisoned at all (this is decided
randomly each time the trap is activated) and the chances that you don't
activate the trap at all - and you arrive at really small probability of that
thing happening. The chances that you get killed by a killer bee sting
(which can also be immediately fatal) ale higher. Therefore I don't believe
that dart traps are most fatal things in the mines (polymorph traps are much
more dangerous...)

Plus, as others pointed out, you should try to get poison resistanse as soon
as possible - there are many poisonous things in nethack, an every of them
can be fatal if you are not resistant.
